*.7z

# Flutter Windows generated (keep windows/runner, windows/CMakeLists.txt, vendor
# SDKs, and windows/flutter/CMakeLists.txt — the static Flutter build scaffolding
# the release build needs; only ephemeral/ + pub-get-generated files are ignored)
windows/flutter/*
!windows/flutter/CMakeLists.txt

